    for lightning</indent></color>\r\n<color=#D9D1BF>  \u2022<indent=1.1em>Added
    summoning your mount from the start of every run with [X] (D-pad Up on a controller)</indent></color>\r\n<color=#D9D1BF> 
    \u2022<indent=1.1em>Added Captain Mogra Hexfang, a goblin shaman captain who
